  "body": "Discover easy modern living in this brand-new four-bedroom home, offering bright interiors, a quiet setting and a thoughtful layout with room for everyone.\r\n\r\nAn impressive high ceiling in the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a wonderful sense of space. Step out onto the deck for summer dining, a morning coffee or a relaxing evening with friends. A separate upstairs lounge offers another comfortable space for movie nights or quiet relaxation.\r\n\r\nA downstairs bedroom and full bathroom provide flexibility for visiting guests or extended family. Upstairs, three further bedrooms include a master with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite — a welcoming retreat at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n• Four bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Downstairs bedroom and bathroom for added flexibility\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living with an impressive high ceiling\r\n• Separate upstairs family lounge\r\n• Deck for outdoor dining and entertaining\r\n• Sunny, bright interiors in a quiet setting\r\n• Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n• A desirable north–south orientation\r\n \r\n\r\nConveniently positioned for Silverdale’s shopping, local schools, motorway connections and the beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendor wants this home sold. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing, or join us at an open home.\r\n\r\nVisit our showhome at 25 Tack Road, Silverdale.",
